<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</title>
<headline>Pakistani rupee closing rates in kerb market.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tuesday's spot rupee rates in kerb market from Khanani &amp; Kalia Int'l (Pvt) Ltd:</p>
<p>				buying rate	 selling rate</p>
<p>    U.S. dollar	   42.68		 42.73</p>
<p>    Pound sterling	71.45		 71.55</p>
<p>    Deutsche mark	 28.05		 28.10</p>
<p>    Japanese yen	   0.380		 0.382</p>
<p>    Saudi riyal	   11.36		 11.38</p>
<p>    UAE dirham	    11.61		 11.63</p>
<p>    Indian rupee	   1.13		  1.15</p>
<p>    F.E.B.C.		 6.50 pct	    6.75 pct</p>
</text>
